      "content": "that makes sense. to get more specific with the 'informal networks' and 'conflict' aspect, i want to look at how these environments might influence traits like assertiveness or impulse control. for example, in some of the literature i've seen, there's a discussion about how people in high-stress, high-crime urban areas might develop a more aggressive or defensive communication style as a survival mechanism. could you help me write a few multiple-choice scenario questions that would test for these specific traits—like high impulsivity or a tendency toward confrontation—in a way that helps differentiate these urban profiles from more middle-class, suburban ones? i want to make sure the phrasing is 'clinical' so it doesn't look like i'm just making assumptions.",
